<section class="legal-page">
  <p class="eyebrow">privacy</p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: July 31, 2026</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you create an account, modify.at stores your username, email address, password hash, account role, and account date. We do not store your plain-text password.</p>
  <p>When you upload a mod, we store the information and files you submit, including descriptions, images, release files, comments, and download counts.</p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>We use account information to provide sign-in, email verification, uploads, downloads, moderation, and site security. We use mod information to display the catalog and provide downloads to visitors.</p>

  <h2>Storage and service providers</h2>
  <p>modify.at uses Vercel for hosting, Supabase for database and file storage, Hostinger for email delivery, Cloudflare for DNS and network services, and Google reCAPTCHA and AdSense where enabled. These providers may process information as needed to provide their services.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>Signed-out visitors may see Google AdSense advertisements. Google may use cookies or similar technologies to measure and personalize advertising according to its policies. Signed-in users do not receive the site’s ad placements.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and sessions</h2>
  <p>modify.at uses a necessary session cookie for authentication, security tokens, and temporary verification steps. We do not use the session cookie to store your password or email verification code.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can stop using your account at any time. To request account or personal-data help, contact <a href="mailto:support@modify.at">support@modify.at</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:support@modify.at">support@modify.at</a>.</p>
</section>

